WEBVTT

00:00.540 --> 00:03.471
[mellow music]
[柔和的音乐]

00:03.540 --> 00:10.229
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:10.298 --> 00:13.264
- [happy humming]
- [快乐的哼唱]

00:13.333 --> 00:16.643
[fancy accordion music]
[美妙的手风琴音乐]

00:16.712 --> 00:19.609
[French accent]
I am a culinary genius, no?
[法国口音]
我是一个烹饪天才，不是吗？

00:19.678 --> 00:21.333
Here you are, sir.
在这里，先生。

00:21.402 --> 00:23.471
Ze specialty of mah house.
麻屋的泽特产。

00:23.540 --> 00:26.540
Roast salad à la Squidward.
鱿鱼烤沙拉。

00:26.609 --> 00:28.367
[gasp]
Sacré bleu!
[喘气]
圣蓝！

00:28.436 --> 00:29.781
I must apologize, monsieur!
我必须道歉，先生！

00:29.850 --> 00:33.436
I have forgotten
the parsley for the garnish.
我忘记了
装饰用欧芹。

00:33.505 --> 00:35.884
Stay warm,
my little Squidy.
保持温暖，
我的小乌贼

00:35.953 --> 00:36.747
[smooch]
[亲吻]

00:36.815 --> 00:38.540
[shrieks]
Le oww!
[尖叫声]
勒哇！

00:38.609 --> 00:39.884
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:39.953 --> 00:42.505
Typical,
I always forget something.
典型的，
我总是忘记一些事情。

00:42.574 --> 00:44.264
Ugh!
啊!

00:44.333 --> 00:46.988
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

00:47.057 --> 00:50.264
[grunts angrily]
[愤怒地咕哝]

00:52.160 --> 00:53.884
A sea bunny?
海兔？

00:53.953 --> 00:56.264
- [laughter]
- [笑声]

00:56.333 --> 00:59.091
- [shrieks sharply]
Ow!
- [尖锐尖叫]
噢！

00:59.160 --> 01:02.057
[ukulele strumming]
[尤克里里弹奏]

01:02.126 --> 01:04.884
[playful music]
[俏皮的音乐]

01:04.953 --> 01:08.160
That voracious vermin is
ruining my French chef fantasy.
那只贪婪的害虫是
毁了我的法国厨师幻想。

01:08.229 --> 01:09.712
Why--ah!
为什么——啊！

01:09.781 --> 01:11.160
- [shrieks]
- [尖叫]

01:11.229 --> 01:12.195
- Grr!
- 呃！

01:12.264 --> 01:13.747
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:13.815 --> 01:14.919
Oh--oh, no, no, no, no.
哦——哦，不，不，不，不。

01:14.988 --> 01:16.505
I have a ticklish core!
我有一颗怕痒的心！

01:16.574 --> 01:18.953
[laughter]
[笑声]

01:19.022 --> 01:20.436
Oh.
哦。

01:20.505 --> 01:21.747
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

01:22.781 --> 01:24.712
[coughing]
[咳嗽]

01:24.781 --> 01:27.540
[fire alarms ringing]
[火警警报响起]

01:27.609 --> 01:29.574
My roast à la Squidward!
我的烤鱿鱼！

01:29.643 --> 01:33.229
[sizzling]
[嘶嘶声]

01:33.298 --> 01:35.609
[sighs]
[叹气]

01:35.678 --> 01:38.884
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

01:40.678 --> 01:44.229
- [sobbing]
- [抽泣]

01:44.298 --> 01:45.678
- What the--
[growls]
- 什么是--
[咆哮]

01:45.747 --> 01:48.609
Oof!
[gulps]
钱币！
[吞咽]

01:49.333 --> 01:51.988
- [laughs]
- [笑]

01:53.229 --> 01:56.333
["The Blue Danube"
by Johann Strauss II playing]
【《蓝色多瑙河》
由约翰·施特劳斯二世演奏]

01:56.402 --> 01:59.229
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:59.298 --> 02:02.540
[rhythmic munching]
[有节奏的咀嚼]

02:02.609 --> 02:07.195
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:07.264 --> 02:08.367
[record scratch]
[记录刮痕]

02:08.436 --> 02:11.815
- I declare war on bunnies!
- 我向兔子宣战！

02:11.884 --> 02:13.471
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:13.540 --> 02:15.298
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:15.367 --> 02:16.298
- [blows raspberry]
- [吹覆盆子]

02:16.367 --> 02:17.781
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:17.850 --> 02:19.609
- [jibbers]
- [叽叽喳喳]

02:19.678 --> 02:21.953
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:22.022 --> 02:23.609
[groans exasperatedly]
[愤怒地呻吟]

02:23.678 --> 02:26.712
[growls,
screams]
[咆哮，
尖叫声]

02:26.781 --> 02:29.160
I am going to bury that bunny!
我要把那只兔子埋了！

02:29.229 --> 02:30.436
[squeaks]
[吱吱声]

02:30.505 --> 02:32.195
- [giggle,
burps]
- [咯咯笑，
打嗝]

02:32.264 --> 02:35.264
[carefree humming]
[无忧无虑的哼唱]

02:41.022 --> 02:42.022
- [gasp]
- [喘气]

02:44.229 --> 02:45.643
Wow.
哇。

02:45.712 --> 02:49.022
That's the ugliest eggplant
I've ever seen!
这是最丑的茄子
我见过！

02:49.884 --> 02:51.988
I don't think
Squidward would mind
我不认为
章鱼哥会介意的

02:52.057 --> 02:54.678
if I took a little taste.
如果我尝尝的话。

02:54.747 --> 02:55.850
Ooh, come here.
哦，过来吧。

02:55.919 --> 02:59.126
[both straining]
[双方都紧张]

03:01.850 --> 03:04.712
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

03:05.540 --> 03:06.505
[playful music]
[俏皮的音乐]

03:06.574 --> 03:09.574
- [carefree humming]
- [无忧无虑的哼唱]

03:09.643 --> 03:11.643
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:11.712 --> 03:14.643
[deep rumbling]
[低沉的隆隆声]

03:14.712 --> 03:17.367
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:17.436 --> 03:18.884
[squeaks]
[吱吱声]

03:18.953 --> 03:20.678
[sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

03:20.747 --> 03:21.678
[gasp]
[喘气]

03:21.747 --> 03:23.333
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:23.402 --> 03:26.574
- Ha, he's gonna fall
right into my trap.
- 哈，他会摔倒的
正好落入我的陷阱。

03:26.643 --> 03:28.160
[laughs]
[笑]

03:28.229 --> 03:30.091
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

03:30.160 --> 03:31.712
[shrieks]
[尖叫声]

03:31.781 --> 03:33.471
[phone ringing]
- Hello, Animal Control?
[电话铃声]
- 你好，动物控制中心？

03:33.540 --> 03:36.057
I've got a sea bunny
cornered in my garden
我有一只海兔
被困在我的花园里

03:36.126 --> 03:37.436
and need assistance!
并需要帮助！

03:37.505 --> 03:38.781
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

03:38.850 --> 03:42.229
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:42.298 --> 03:45.298
Did you have
to catch him that easily?
你有没有
这么容易就抓住他了？

03:46.574 --> 03:50.643
- I demand the release
of this poor woodland creature.
- 我要求释放
这个可怜的林地生物。

03:50.712 --> 03:52.367
He's got rights too,
you know.
他也有权利，
你知道。

03:52.436 --> 03:55.057
- This is none of your
business, SpongeBob, go away.
- 这不属于你的
生意，海绵宝宝，走开。

03:55.126 --> 03:57.091
- You want him?
You can keep him.
- 你想要他吗？
你可以留住他。

03:57.160 --> 03:59.678
Saves me a trip
to the incinerator.
为我节省了一次旅行
到焚烧炉。

03:59.747 --> 04:00.815
- Hooray!
- 万岁！

04:00.884 --> 04:04.091
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

04:05.815 --> 04:07.229
- I'm warning you, SpongeBob.
- 我警告你，海绵宝宝。

04:07.298 --> 04:10.160
Keep that filthy animal
away from my--
保留那只肮脏的动物
远离我的——

04:11.333 --> 04:13.229
- [sing-song voice]
Vegetables!
- [唱歌声音]
蔬菜！

04:13.298 --> 04:14.953
That's what you like,
isn't it, bunny?
这就是你喜欢的，
不是吗，兔子？

04:15.022 --> 04:16.436
We'll see what we got
in the fridge.
我们会看看我们得到了什么
在冰箱里。

04:16.505 --> 04:17.884
- [sniffing]
- [嗅嗅]

04:17.953 --> 04:19.160
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

04:19.229 --> 04:20.712
- Whoops,
I'm out of veggies.
- 哎呀，
我没有蔬菜了

04:20.781 --> 04:21.815
But I got something
even better.
但我得到了一些东西
甚至更好。

04:21.884 --> 04:24.747
Gary's food! Yay!
加里的食物！耶！

04:24.815 --> 04:26.229
[woman shrieks]
[女人尖叫]

04:26.298 --> 04:28.505
Does bunny wunny
like his dinny winny?
兔子wunny吗
喜欢他的 dinny winny 吗？

04:28.574 --> 04:29.781
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

04:31.471 --> 04:34.057
All right, Gary's food is out.
Got it.
好吧，加里的食物吃完了。
知道了。

04:34.126 --> 04:36.574
I'll get you veggies.
I'll be right back.
我给你买蔬菜。
我马上回来。

04:38.264 --> 04:39.747
[wails]
[哀号]

04:39.815 --> 04:40.850
[explosions]
[爆炸]

04:40.919 --> 04:42.126
- [rumbling]
- [隆隆声]

04:43.057 --> 04:45.988
[mischievous music]
[恶作剧的音乐]

04:46.057 --> 04:53.264
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:56.747 --> 04:57.747
[shrieks]
[尖叫声]

04:57.815 --> 04:59.229
[electricity fizzling]
[电嘶嘶作响]

04:59.298 --> 05:01.022
- [sing-song voice]
Bunny wunny!
- [唱歌声音]
兔兔旺尼！

05:01.091 --> 05:02.402
I've got a surprise
for you--
我有一个惊喜
为了你——

05:02.471 --> 05:04.988
[screaming]
[尖叫]

05:05.057 --> 05:07.678
[electricity crackling]
[电力噼啪声]

05:08.505 --> 05:11.160
I'm gonna have to chew-proof
this whole house fast!
我得防咀嚼
这整个房子快！

05:11.229 --> 05:12.919
Hot sauce ought
to do the trick.
辣酱应该
来做到这一点。

05:12.988 --> 05:15.919
[playful music]
[俏皮的音乐]

05:15.988 --> 05:18.919
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:18.988 --> 05:21.471
- [sniffing,
tongue smacking]
- [嗅，
咂舌]

05:21.540 --> 05:22.781
[loud burp]
[大声打嗝]

05:22.850 --> 05:23.815
[excited squeal]
[兴奋尖叫]

05:23.884 --> 05:26.574
[naughty giggle]
[顽皮的傻笑]

05:26.643 --> 05:28.574
[slurping noises]
[吸吮声]

05:28.643 --> 05:29.678
[loud burp]
[大声打嗝]

05:29.747 --> 05:31.850
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:31.919 --> 05:32.850
[slurping]
[发出声音]

05:32.919 --> 05:34.402
[burp]
[打嗝]

05:34.471 --> 05:36.540
[squeals]
[尖叫声]

05:36.609 --> 05:38.850
- Huh? No, no, no, no!
- 啊？不，不，不，不！

05:38.919 --> 05:44.057
[panicked squeaking]
[惊慌的尖叫声]

05:44.126 --> 05:46.471
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

05:46.540 --> 05:49.471
- [gulping,
sigh]
- [吞咽，
叹息]

05:49.540 --> 05:50.471
- [panicked meow]
- [惊慌喵]

05:50.540 --> 05:52.057
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:52.126 --> 05:53.126
- [loud burp]
- [大声打嗝]

05:53.195 --> 05:54.471
- My comic books!
- 我的漫画书！

05:54.540 --> 05:55.919
[battle cry]
[战斗呐喊]

05:55.988 --> 05:58.540
- [gargling]
- [漱口]

05:58.609 --> 06:00.195
[low whistle]
[低声哨声]

06:01.436 --> 06:03.367
- I gotta get rid
of all that hot sauce.
- 我得摆脱
所有的辣酱。

06:03.436 --> 06:06.367
[playful music]
[俏皮的音乐]

06:06.436 --> 06:09.126
[slurping noises]
[吸吮声]

06:09.195 --> 06:10.402
[tongue smacking]
[咂舌]

06:11.609 --> 06:13.712
[shrieks sharply]
[尖锐尖叫]

06:13.781 --> 06:14.781
Oh, oh, oh!
哦，哦，哦！

06:14.850 --> 06:16.505
Oh, oh, oh, oh!
哦，哦，哦，哦！

06:16.574 --> 06:18.953
[toilet whizzing]
[厕所的声音]

06:20.643 --> 06:21.919
Here we are!
我们到了！

06:21.988 --> 06:23.953
Water supply--check.
供水——检查。

06:24.022 --> 06:26.367
Trampoline for hopping--check.
用于跳跃的蹦床——检查。

06:26.436 --> 06:28.540
Buckteeth sharpener--check.
龅牙磨刀器——检查。

06:28.609 --> 06:31.229
And an adding machine
for multiplying...
还有加法机
为了乘以...

06:31.298 --> 06:32.229
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

06:32.298 --> 06:34.057
Triple check-aroonie!
三重检查-阿鲁尼！

06:34.126 --> 06:36.298
Now the bunny will be more than
happy to stay in his cage.
现在兔子将超过
很高兴呆在他的笼子里。

06:36.367 --> 06:37.712
Huh?
啊？

06:37.781 --> 06:39.643
- [sniffing]
- [嗅嗅]

06:39.712 --> 06:41.678
[shrieks]
- [yelps]
[尖叫声]
- [尖叫声]

06:41.747 --> 06:43.229
- [heavy breathing]
- [粗重的呼吸]

06:43.298 --> 06:45.609
- Doesn't like cage...
- 不喜欢笼子...

06:45.678 --> 06:46.643
Check.
查看。

06:46.712 --> 06:47.850
- [heavy breathing]
- [粗重的呼吸]

06:47.919 --> 06:49.609
[growls]
[咆哮]

06:49.678 --> 06:51.367
[mischievous music]
[恶作剧的音乐]

06:51.436 --> 06:52.540
- No, no, bunny,
don't go in there.
- 不，不，兔子，
不要进去。

06:52.609 --> 06:53.712
You'll get lost!
你会迷路的！

06:53.781 --> 06:54.884
I need my jellyfishing net.
我需要我的捕水母网。

06:54.953 --> 06:56.505
Where did I put that thing?
我把那个东西放在哪里了？

06:56.574 --> 06:58.264
Probably dropped
it in here somewhere.
可能掉落
它就在这里的某个地方。

06:58.333 --> 07:00.919
Nyah, nyah--
ah, got it!
呀呀呀——
啊，明白了！

07:00.988 --> 07:02.678
- Hello!
- 你好！

07:02.747 --> 07:04.367
- Patrick, did you fall
between the cushions again?
- 帕特里克，你摔倒了吗
又在坐垫之间吗？

07:04.436 --> 07:07.471
- No, SpongeBob,
I fell between the cushions.
- 不，海绵宝宝，
我跌倒在垫子之间。

07:07.540 --> 07:11.574
But I have a solution
to your bunny problem.
但我有一个解决方案
解决你的兔子问题。

07:11.643 --> 07:13.643
I love the hunt!
我喜欢狩猎！

07:13.712 --> 07:15.747
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:15.815 --> 07:17.195
[crashes]
[崩溃]

07:17.264 --> 07:19.264
[straining noises]
[紧张的声音]

07:19.333 --> 07:21.436
- [panicked squeaking]
No, no!
- [惊慌的尖叫声]
不，不！

07:21.505 --> 07:23.540
No, don't!
Please don't! That's my--
不，不要！
请不要！那是我的——

07:23.609 --> 07:25.091
[crashes]
[崩溃]

07:25.160 --> 07:26.333
All right, Patrick,
that's enough hunting.
好吧，帕特里克，
狩猎就够了。

07:26.402 --> 07:27.747
You can come out now.
你现在可以出来了。

07:27.815 --> 07:30.781
- I can't see where I'm going.
- 我看不到我要去哪里。

07:30.850 --> 07:33.126
How do I get out of here?
我怎样才能离开这里？

07:33.195 --> 07:34.609
[panicked screams]
[惊慌的尖叫声]

07:34.678 --> 07:38.815
[distant]
SpongeBob, where are I?
[远方]
海绵宝宝，我在哪里？

07:38.884 --> 07:41.126
- Stay where you are, Patrick!
I've got an idea.
- 留在原地，帕特里克！
我有一个主意。

07:41.195 --> 07:42.505
To the pet shop!
去宠物店！

07:42.574 --> 07:45.126
[video game jingle]
[panting]
[电子游戏顺口溜]
[气喘吁吁]

07:45.195 --> 07:46.678
Thank you!
谢谢你！

07:46.747 --> 07:48.884
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

07:48.953 --> 07:50.988
Patrick!
I bought a second bunny
帕特里克！
我又买了第二只兔子

07:51.057 --> 07:52.815
to lure the first bunny
out of hiding.
引诱第一只兔子
从躲藏中出来。

07:52.884 --> 07:54.126
- Hooray!
- 万岁！

07:54.195 --> 07:56.781
[playful music]
[俏皮的音乐]

07:56.850 --> 07:57.953
- [strains]
- [菌株]

07:58.022 --> 08:01.988
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:02.057 --> 08:03.057
- [excited squeak]
- [兴奋的吱吱声]

08:03.126 --> 08:05.298
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:05.367 --> 08:06.678
[sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

08:06.747 --> 08:07.781
- [gasp]
- [喘气]

08:07.850 --> 08:10.781
[tango music]
[探戈音乐]

08:10.850 --> 08:13.884
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:13.953 --> 08:16.884
[accordion tango music]
[手风琴探戈音乐]

08:16.953 --> 08:19.884
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:19.953 --> 08:21.264
- [straining]
- [紧张]

08:21.333 --> 08:22.678
- Hold still, Patrick,
I see you.
- 保持不动，帕特里克，
我看到你了。

08:24.160 --> 08:27.195
- [gasps, sighs]
Thanks, buddy.
- [喘气，叹气]
谢谢，伙计。

08:28.160 --> 08:30.160
Aww, bunnies!
哇，兔子们！

08:30.229 --> 08:32.264
[both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

08:32.333 --> 08:34.988
[bunnies boinging]
[兔子的嗡嗡声]

08:35.057 --> 08:36.574
- [laughing]
- [笑]

08:36.643 --> 08:38.953
- One, two...
- 一，二……

08:39.022 --> 08:40.160
Three?
三？

08:40.229 --> 08:42.643
[bunnies giggling]
[兔子咯咯地笑]

08:42.712 --> 08:44.160
- More bunnies!
- 更多兔子！

08:44.229 --> 08:45.815
- [nervous laugh]
Yay!
- [紧张的笑声]
耶！

08:45.884 --> 08:47.091
- [rumbling]
- [隆隆声]

08:47.160 --> 08:50.402
[squeaking]
[吱吱声]

08:50.471 --> 08:51.574
- Uh-oh.
- 呃哦。

08:52.367 --> 08:54.643
Patrick, the hunt is on!
帕特里克，狩猎开始了！

08:54.712 --> 08:56.505
[both ululate]
[两人都喊叫]

08:56.574 --> 08:59.609
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

09:01.643 --> 09:03.298
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

09:04.781 --> 09:06.229
- Hey!
- 嘿！

09:07.126 --> 09:09.574
Come back, bunny wunnies!
回来吧，小兔子们！

09:10.574 --> 09:14.505
- [French accent]
This is the last carrot.
- [法国口音]
这是最后一根胡萝卜。

09:14.574 --> 09:16.160
C'est la vie.
这就是生活。

09:16.229 --> 09:17.747
- [excited hum]
- [兴奋的嗡嗡声]

09:17.815 --> 09:20.436
- One more step,
and I will spit you on a roast!
- 再多一步，
我会把你吐在烤肉上！

09:20.505 --> 09:22.264
I mean,
roast you on a spit!
我的意思是，
把你烤了！

09:22.333 --> 09:24.333
[low rumbling]
[低沉的隆隆声]

09:24.402 --> 09:27.126
Oh, oh, what's happening?
噢，噢，发生什么事了？

09:27.195 --> 09:30.022
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

09:30.091 --> 09:31.367
- Don't worry, Squidward.
- 别担心，章鱼哥。

09:31.436 --> 09:33.264
- Yeah.
We're here to help!
- 是的。
我们随时为您提供帮助！

09:33.333 --> 09:34.884
- They're growing!
- 他们正在成长！

09:34.953 --> 09:37.402
[shrieks]
[尖叫声]

09:37.471 --> 09:40.091
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

09:40.160 --> 09:42.643
[panicked breathing]
[惊慌的呼吸]

09:42.712 --> 09:43.919
[phone trilling]
[电话颤音]

09:43.988 --> 09:45.402
Hello, Animal Control?
你好，动物控制中心吗？

09:45.471 --> 09:47.022
Save me!
救救我吧！

09:47.091 --> 09:50.022
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

09:50.091 --> 09:51.988
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:52.057 --> 09:55.678
[nervous blubbering]
[紧张的哭泣]

09:55.747 --> 10:00.298
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:00.367 --> 10:02.333
[old man groan]
[老人呻吟]

10:03.574 --> 10:05.057
[growls]
[咆哮]

10:05.126 --> 10:07.988
[angry moaning]
[愤怒的呻吟声]

10:08.057 --> 10:09.091
[spits]
[吐口水]

10:09.160 --> 10:11.678
Get out of my house!
滚出我家！

10:12.815 --> 10:13.919
Gah!
嘎！

10:13.988 --> 10:15.574
That'll get them out.
这样就能把他们救出来了。

10:15.643 --> 10:18.850
[wobbling noises,
crackling]
[颤抖的声音，
噼啪声]

10:18.919 --> 10:20.781
[screams]
[尖叫声]

10:22.609 --> 10:25.022
- Sorry about your house,
Squidward.
- 对不起你的房子，
章鱼哥。

10:25.091 --> 10:27.540
- Yeah. We just heard.
- 是的。我们刚刚听说。

10:28.540 --> 10:29.574
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

10:31.126 --> 10:32.712
[chirping]
[叽叽喳喳]

10:32.781 --> 10:34.643
[maniacal laughter]
[疯狂的笑声]

10:34.712 --> 10:36.229
I'm a bunny now!
我现在是一只兔子了！

10:36.298 --> 10:38.160
[crazy laughter]
I'm a bunny now!
[疯狂的笑声]
我现在是一只兔子了！

10:38.229 --> 10:41.850
- Okay,
Mr. Tentacles, easy does it.
- 好吧，
触手先生，很容易做到。

10:41.919 --> 10:43.195
[grunts]
[咕哝]

10:43.264 --> 10:45.609
- [squeaks,
maniacal laughter]
- [吱吱声，
疯狂的笑声]

10:45.678 --> 10:46.919
I'm a bunny now!
我现在是一只兔子了！

10:46.988 --> 10:50.057
[laughter]
I'm a bunny now!
[笑声]
我现在是一只兔子了！

10:50.126 --> 10:53.953
[bunnies purring]
[兔子咕咕叫]

10:54.022 --> 10:56.057
- [angry Squidward noises]
- [章鱼哥愤怒的声音]

10:56.126 --> 10:59.333
[toots clarinet]
[嘟嘟单簧管]

11:01.815 --> 11:04.747
[mellow music]
[柔和的音乐]

11:04.815 --> 11:11.884
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪